Balance rationale (documented for tuners): a centre base (100%) with 1 mine + 1 solar + 1 factory nets +1 component / 2s once built (~360 s to afford the factory from start); an edge base (30%) produces at 0.3× and needs ~3× the mines or a faction link (+10) / booster (+10) to catch up — distance hurts but never soft-locks.

